# Searchlyst Development Configuration
# ==============================================================================
# NOTE: Searchlyst works 100% OUT-OF-THE-BOX with ZERO API keys required!
# The extension uses public, rate-resilient endpoints for daily developer searches.
#
# You ONLY need to configure the optional variables below if you are:
# 1. Developing high-volume integrations
# 2. Experiencing public IP rate limits on GitHub or StackExchange
# ==============================================================================

# Optional: GitHub Personal Access Token (classic or fine-grained)
# - Increases GitHub search rate limits from 60 requests/hour to 5,000 requests/hour.
# - Generate at: https://github.com/settings/tokens (no special scopes required for public repo search)
GITHUB_TOKEN=

# Optional: StackExchange / Stack Overflow API Key
# - Increases daily request quota from 300 requests/day to 10,000 requests/day.
# - Register an app key at: https://stackapps.com/apps/oauth/register
STACKEXCHANGE_KEY=

# Local Standalone Preview Server Port
PORT=3888
